/P 145 0 R
/E (The mean filter is a simple spatial filtering technique used for noise reduction. It works by replacing each pixel value with the average of its neighboring pixels within a defined window. This averaging operation effectively smooths the image and reduces random noise variations.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
269 0 obj
<<
